OL,4,BAlcaraz continues winning run despite  
OL,5,Binjury concern                         
OL,6,GCarlos Alcaraz continued his           
OL,7,Gsensational late-season form as he     
OL,8,Goutclassed world number five Daniil    
OL,9,GMedvedev to reach the knockout stage   
OL,10,Gat the ATP Finals.                     
OL,12,FBut the 23-year-old Spaniard later     
OL,13,Fsaid he had felt "a little problem"    
OL,14,Fwith his hamstring.                    
OL,16,FAlcaraz produced another sparkling     
OL,17,Fdisplay to control the contest         
OL,18,Fthroughout, despite ending the match   
OL,19,Fwith heavy strapping on his upper-left 
OL,20,Fleg.                                   
